OpenBRender 0.1.0 local release

This source distribution includes OpenBioFigure by Voldigoade and contributors,
licensed under Apache-2.0. Upstream source:
https://github.com/Voldigoade/openbiofigure
Pinned commit: 8f72679efc26c821737cc3adb2ddca033150f06e

OpenBRender (formerly OpenRender) changes include bounded project validation, an explicit SVG policy,
local import/export validation, untrusted provenance handling, a static browser
entry point, hosting headers, and browser validation fixtures. Original file headers
and license notices are retained. See docs/upstream-source.lock.json for the public upstream revision.

Scientific artwork and fonts have separate licenses. 583 pinned Bioicons drawings
(296 CC0 and 287 CC BY 4.0) are included in app/public-browser/artwork, with
creator, source, original and normalized integrity evidence recorded in
app/src/assets/packs/library-manifest.json. See docs/ARTWORK_LIBRARY.md and
docs/audit/artwork-inventory.json. Servier art is not distributed.
Bundled Barlow, IBM Plex and STIX Two Text fonts retain their SIL OFL notices in
app/public-browser/licenses.

The app and audit harness include DOMPurify 3.4.14 under its retained dual
Apache-2.0 or MPL-2.0 license. See vendor/dompurify/LICENSE and UPSTREAM.json.

Fabric 7.4.0 is vendored under MIT from the pinned official v740 browser
distribution. See vendor/fabric/LICENSE and UPSTREAM.json. Other bundled
dependency notices are included with the local distribution.
